!.env.example
# Committed production build config: the R2 URL for the NNUE net. Not a secret —
# every VITE_* value is inlined into the client bundle anyway. Vite reads it only
# for `vite build`, so `npm run dev` still uses the locally staged net. Written by
# `npm run nnue:setup`; a real env var (e.g. in Cloudflare Pages) overrides it.
!.env.production
PROJECT_STATUS.md
CLAUDE.md
PASS*_PLAN.md
# Agent handoff / planning docs (same convention as PASS*_PLAN.md)
HANDOFF-*.md
dist-worker
worker.env
.env.worker

# Stockfish's NNUE network, staged into public/ by scripts/copy-nnue.mjs
# (prebuild / predev). 40 MB of binary that ships inside the `stockfish` npm
# package -- committing it would grow every clone and every history forever,
# for something `npm ci` already puts on disk. See the script's header.
public/stockfish/*.nnue
